{"id":"c4a41b9f-8744-4cbc-8587-734ca3018141","title":"Session 14: Bäder, Betrügereien und Bestien.","excerpt":"Kian, Wolv und Sammy (Arran hat sich eine Pause gegönnt) werden von Sigmar Gabreul auf den neuesten Stand gebracht: in Kar-Durak gab es einen Einsturz, als eine Expedition der Liga den hinteren Teil der verlassenen Mine der Zwerge öffnen wollte, die Liga hat den Herzog veranlasst, einen Trupp zur Sicherung des Opalturm und des dort platzierten Eis zu schicken und es gibt einen Plan, das verlassene Dorf beim entweihten Tempel von St. Terragnis wieder aufzubauen. Hierzu muss das Flüstern des...","firstPublishedDate":"2026-08-22T08:15:30Z","lastPublishedDate":"2026-08-22T18:23:44.812Z","url":{"base":"https://tkopp37.wixsite.com/fackeln-am-abgrund","path":"/post/session-14-von-bädern-betrügereien-und-einer-monströsen-schlange"},"slug":"session-14-von-bädern-betrügereien-und-einer-monströsen-schlange","featured":false,"pinned":false,"categoryIds":["ee457603-61ed-4653-b4bf-3d717d888929"],"memberId":"860736e2-ac6e-4c8e-8509-6e7cd2f20f65","hashtags":[],"commentingEnabled":true,"minutesToRead":3,"tagIds":[],"relatedPostIds":[],"pricingPlanIds":[],"language":"de","richContent":{"nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"5u6ag23688","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Kian, Wolv und Sammy (Arran hat sich eine Pause gegönnt) werden von Sigmar Gabreul auf den neuesten Stand gebracht:","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"BULLETED_LIST","id":"tic8z47362","nodes":[{"type":"LIST_ITEM","id":"y7v3p47363","nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"wdx1g16043","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"in Kar-Durak gab es einen Einsturz, als eine Expedition der Liga den hinteren Teil der verlassenen Mine der Zwerge öffnen wollte,","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}}]},{"type":"LIST_ITEM","id":"gpjkj47475","nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"ig9f447476","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"die Liga hat den Herzog veranlasst, einen Trupp zur Sicherung des Opalturm und des dort platzierten Eis zu schicken und ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}}]},{"type":"LIST_ITEM","id":"w57em47534","nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"7lvo247535","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"es gibt einen Plan, das verlassene Dorf beim entweihten Tempel von St. Terragnis wieder aufzubauen. Hierzu muss das Flüstern des Tempels aber endgültig gestoppt werden.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}}]}],"bulletedListData":{"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"37yes47768","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Wolf hat während seines Tages \"off\" in Abendail übrigens Kontakt zu ","decorations":[]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Fatma","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700},{"type":"SKETCH","sketchData":{"variant":"UNDERLINE","color":"$theme-color-3"}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":", einem Mitglied der \"","decorations":[]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Gesellschaft der Stillen Hand","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700},{"type":"SKETCH","sketchData":{"variant":"UNDERLINE","color":"$theme-color-3"}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"\", wieder aufleben lassen.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"i64am21190","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"}}},{"type":"HEADING","id":"u7q9e874","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Kians Abenteuerbericht","decorations":[]}}],"headingData":{"level":2}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"906xx21203","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"“Man sagt, ein guter Barde muss drei Dinge gut können: singen, kämpfen und überzeugend Geschichten erzählen. Den Rest kann man sich unterwegs aneignen.","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"lrfhv28","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"af8vj29","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Zunächst kehrten wir zur Liga zurück. Die alten Hasen dort kennen uns inzwischen. ","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Martin, der Experte für Bestien","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700},{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true},{"type":"SKETCH","sketchData":{"variant":"UNDERLINE","color":"$theme-color-3"}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":", klärte uns über unsere Statuen auf: Das Ding mit den vielen Mündern? Äußerst gefährlich. Der Namenlose? Wenn wir ihn sehen: rennen. Und die Rauchwolke aus dem Sarg war ein Rauchelementar. Offenbar kann man auch das irgendwie besiegen.","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"5jjxh31","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"xus3132","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Sigmar Gabreul bestätigte außerdem, dass der Kult tatsächlich seinen Hauptsitz im Badehaus bei den ","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Raists Quellen","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700},{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true},{"type":"SKETCH","sketchData":{"variant":"UNDERLINE","color":"$theme-color-3"}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" hat. Zehn Gold gab es obendrauf. Also beschlossen wir, uns zunächst eine wohlverdiente Erholung zu gönnen.","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"qowms34","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"lsrul35","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Im Badehaus lernte ich ","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Henry ","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700},{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true},{"type":"SKETCH","sketchData":{"variant":"UNDERLINE","color":"$theme-color-3"}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"kennen, einen Kaufmann und Besitzer von ","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Henrys Emporium","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700},{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true},{"type":"SKETCH","sketchData":{"variant":"UNDERLINE","color":"$theme-color-3"}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":". Ein Mann mit Geschmack – zehn Prozent Rabatt auf alles für mich. Außerdem hat er ein kleines Problem: Seine Tochter soll einen Mann heiraten, den er für völlig ungeeignet hält.","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"l2qro37","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"8gctl38","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Der Plan: Ich singe bei der Hochzeit. Nur eben so furchtbar, dass die Hochzeit platzt.","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"2gcvm40","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"8vi8s41","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Wolv bekam eine Massage, Sammy ebenfalls. Ich selbst musste leider feststellen, dass eine Massage offenbar doch nicht automatisch im Preis enthalten war. Eine kurze, aber bedauerliche geschäftliche Meinungsverschiedenheit.","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"io0sb43","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"j4vok44","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Später verschlug es mich in die ","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Heringslounge","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700},{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true},{"type":"SKETCH","sketchData":{"variant":"UNDERLINE","color":"$theme-color-3"}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":". Eigentlich wollte ich nur Musiker für die Hochzeit finden. Dann stand da diese Bühne.","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"hspoe46","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"lspag47","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Ich erzählte eine Geschichte. Der Raum verstummte. Die Menschen hingen an meinen Lippen. Und weil ich nicht nur gut aussehe, sondern auch ein großzügiger Künstler bin, teilte ich mein Trinkgeld mit den Musikern. Seitdem kennt man mich dort.","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"fb8kn49","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"feiio50","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"IMAGE","id":"cl9wi194","nodes":[{"type":"CAPTION","id":"ewlhb207","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Der Hut.","decorations":[]}}]}],"imageData":{"containerData":{"width":{"size":"SMALL"},"alignment":"LEFT","textWrap":true},"image":{"src":{"id":"860736_d2d3b8accbcd44a98fab9516278ccdc9~mv2.webp"},"width":1122,"height":1402},"caption":"Der Hut."}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"a6prr208","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Am nächsten Morgen ging ich noch einmal zu Henry, um unseren Deal mit der Hochzeit zu besiegeln. Als Gegenleistung gab es für mich ein Schild, für Wolv eine ","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"rot-weiß gestreifte Hose mit blauen Bändern","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700},{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true},{"type":"SKETCH","sketchData":{"variant":"UNDERLINE","color":"$theme-color-3"}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":", die ihn besonders schützt, wenn er sonst nichts trägt, und für Sammy einen ","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"blauen Spitzhut mit Sternen","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700},{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true},{"type":"SKETCH","sketchData":{"variant":"UNDERLINE","color":"$theme-color-3"}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":".","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"ejea052","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"gdf8b53","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Der Hut spricht.","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"kfkuh55","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"pjyqj56","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Ich denke, er gibt unserer Gruppe noch das gewisse Etwas.","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"zfqrb58","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"qe03w59","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Danach ging es in den ","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Fight Club","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700},{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true},{"type":"SKETCH","sketchData":{"variant":"UNDERLINE","color":"$theme-color-3"}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" im Hafenviertel. Erst Hühnerkampf, dann wurde es ernst: Wolv stieg gegen den Ork-Champion in den Ring – von mir liebevoll „Kunzi“ getauft.","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"clukf61","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"qhtay62","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Ein Kampf auf Leben und Tod.","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"4ezdh64","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"xht4v65","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Zumindest in meiner Erzählung.","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"vssf067","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"y1uzs68","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Wolv gewann hauchdünn und ist nun Champion. Ich wiederum konnte dem Arena-Besitzer ","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Gerard Labas","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700},{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true},{"type":"SKETCH","sketchData":{"variant":"UNDERLINE","color":"$theme-color-3"}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" klarmachen, dass unsere zukünftigen Auftritte dort selbstverständlich keine Störung, sondern ein besonderes Unterhaltungsprogramm darstellen.","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"9443f70","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"d7ck271","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Dann zurück zum eigentlichen Geschäft: dem Tempel außerhalb der Stadt.","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"h5sj374","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"IMAGE","id":"hboi6260","nodes":[{"type":"CAPTION","id":"wtoen281","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Sammy kämpft gegen eine Riesenschlange.","decorations":[]}}]}],"imageData":{"containerData":{"width":{"size":"SMALL"},"alignment":"RIGHT","textWrap":true},"image":{"src":{"id":"860736_6a50ac45adbf4bbe9e4208f0a9c8f20e~mv2.webp"},"width":724,"height":543},"caption":"Sammy kämpft gegen eine Riesenschlange."}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"tv80y282","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Zum Warmwerden erlegten wir einen Kultisten. Im Innenhof brachte Sammy ein Opfer auf dem Opferaltar dar – woraufhin eine riesige, monströse Schlange erschien und Sammy mit einem einzigen Biss fürs Erste aus dem Geschehen nahm.","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"zjmk876","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"0q6ka77","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Ich lenkte das Biest auf mich und lockte es in den Turm. Während Wolv auf seine Gelegenheit wartete, sprang ich über die Schlange hinweg, erreichte Sammy und brachte ihn zurück. Wolv erledigte währenddessen das Monster.","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"l02qr79","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"ewm8q80","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Auf dem Opferaltar blieb ein blutender ","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Dolch ","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700},{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true},{"type":"SKETCH","sketchData":{"variant":"UNDERLINE","color":"$theme-color-3"}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"zurück. Sammy nahm ihn an sich und musste dabei eine gewisse geistige Stärke aufbringen, um dem Einfluss des Dolches zu widerstehen. Seitdem hinterlässt das Ding eine kleine Blutspur.","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"616nd82","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"gvahq83","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Im anderen Turm fanden wir schließlich noch eine Luke und eine Wendeltreppe. Eine Falle erkannten wir. Eine Fallgrube leider nicht.","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"g6yds85","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"l9yir86","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Nachdem ich mir eine Fallgrube mal aus der Nähe genauer angesehen hatte und dabei auch noch Sammy mit hineinziehen musste, entschieden wir uns für einen taktischen Rückzug.","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"4im7h88","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"evqoe89","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Ein ganz normaler Abend also: Wir haben einen Champion hervorgebracht, eine Hochzeit zur Sabotage vorbereitet, einen sprechenden Hut gewonnen, eine monströse Schlange erschlagen, Sammy wieder ins Geschehen zurückgebracht und einen blutenden Dolch eingesammelt.","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"hrk2w91","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"f4ldy92","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Man könnte fast meinen, wir hätten einen Plan.”","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}}],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"ud8599350","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"HEADING","id":"5lazs919","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Plan.","decorations":[]}}],"headingData":{"level":2}},{"type":"BULLETED_LIST","id":"rj33p9677","nodes":[{"type":"LIST_ITEM","id":"0pyov9678","nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"bgrl8921","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Kultisten aus dem Tempel vertreiben.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}}]},{"type":"LIST_ITEM","id":"9gdhq9722","nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"6d16c9723","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Hochzeit von Henrys Tochter platzen lassen.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}}]}],"bulletedListData":{"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"kes1648593","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{}},{"type":"HEADING","id":"7k1hv923","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Wichtige Infos.","decorations":[]}}],"headingData":{"level":2}},{"type":"BULLETED_LIST","id":"8g9pn925","nodes":[{"type":"LIST_ITEM","id":"jqskj926","nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"ha1me927","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Neue Verbindung zum Fight Club und zu Henry von Henrys Emporium.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}}]},{"type":"LIST_ITEM","id":"4uds74176","nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"gjw144177","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Erster Kontakt zu Raist in Raists Quellen.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}}]},{"type":"LIST_ITEM","id":"jby0d6446","nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"y954u6447","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Date für einen Auftritt bei der Hochzeit von Henrys Tochter.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}}]},{"type":"LIST_ITEM","id":"6rzna57001","nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"45fwg57002","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Kontakt zu Fatma, einem Mitglied der \"Gesellschaft der Stillen Hand\".","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{}}]}],"bulletedListData":{"indentation":0}}],"documentStyle":{}},"preview":false,"contentId":"6a895aa2f46f94d7c1a0f956","mostRecentContributorId":"860736e2-ac6e-4c8e-8509-6e7cd2f20f65","media":{"wixMedia":{"image":{"id":"860736_6a50ac45adbf4bbe9e4208f0a9c8f20e~mv2.webp","url":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/860736_6a50ac45adbf4bbe9e4208f0a9c8f20e~mv2.webp","height":543,"width":724,"filename":"Schlange.webp"}},"displayed":true,"custom":true},"hasUnpublishedChanges":false,"translations":[],"customExcerpt":false,"internalCategoryIds":[],"internalRelatedPostIds":[]}
